  "text": "Stop letting client feedback get lost across endless Slack messages, emails, and WhatsApp. Scattering creative revision notes across disconnected channels leads to missed change requests and angry clients. Without a single source of truth, designers make conflicting edits that trigger costly project delays. Route all deliverable reviews through a branded Copilot portal with structured feedback forms and Loom embeds. You eliminate revision chaos while cutting turnaround time in half.",
